WEBVTT

00:02:57.006 --> 00:03:00.509
We all have our own
beautiful ways of moving,

00:03:00.509 --> 00:03:03.054
and this is worth celebrating.

00:03:03.930 --> 00:03:08.309
It’s time to extract the judgment
out of our dance experience

00:03:08.309 --> 00:03:12.063
and set free the preconceived notion
of what "good" dance is.

00:03:12.480 --> 00:03:13.606
And instead ...

00:03:15.274 --> 00:03:18.736
find out how your own body loves to move,

00:03:18.778 --> 00:03:21.697
and find out that inner rhythm

00:03:21.697 --> 00:03:23.241
that feels so good.

00:03:24.075 --> 00:03:26.327
Think more body ...

00:03:27.161 --> 00:03:28.496
less critique.